<!--
  Every word Mira says on a surface the system draws: the launcher's shortcut menu, the widget
  picker, the home screen and the Quick Settings shade.

  These are resources rather than the phrasebooks the app screens use, because the system renders
  them in the device's own language beside every other app's entries, and it renders them while
  Mira is not running. values-bn/ carries the Bengali.
-->
<resources>
